  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 24. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. カヌー — パドルを使って進む細長い小舟。\n2. 可能性 — そうなるかもしれないという見込み。\n3. 過半数 — 全体の半分を超える数。\n4. カバー — 物を覆って守るもの。\n5. カフェ — 飲み物や軽い食事を出す店。\n6. カフェテリア — 好きな料理を自分で選んで受け取る食堂。\n7. 貨幣 — 物を買うときなどに使うお金。\n8. 髪型 — 髪の形や整え方。\n9. 貨物 — 運ぶ対象となる品物や荷物。\n10. カヤック — 両端に水かきのあるパドルでこぐ小舟。\n11. 辛口 — 辛みが強い味。\n12. 体つき — 体の形や骨組みの見え方。\n13. 空振り — 振ったバットなどが狙った物に当たらないこと。\n14. カラメル — 砂糖を熱して作る褐色のもの。\n15. カラー — 色のこと。\n16. 刈り入れ — 実った稲や麦などを刈って収穫すること。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\n",
